1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,585
Woman: How are preparations for tomorrow's meeting with the board coming along.

2
00:00:03,585 --> 00:00:05,240
Is your marketing presentation all set?

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:08,160
Man: Almost. I've finalized the slides

4
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:12,170
but I still need to print the handouts, and the printer's acting up.

5
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:17,160
Woman: Again? That's the third time this week. Do you want me to check it out?

6
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:22,030
The last couple of times I had an issue, I managed to get it working again.

7
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:26,160
Man: That would be great. I've already tried fiddling with it, but no luck.

8
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:29,180
Woman: I'll head down to the copy room right now and see what I can do.
